WEBVTT

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:12.674
Without even knowing it,
Neil was falling in love with Candy.

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:14.301
After knowing this,

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:20.012
Eliza asks her mother to drive
Candy out of Chicago.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:26.119
After Eliza's mom met the director,
Candy was asked to the director's office.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.861
The memories come back

00:00:34.802 --> 00:00:41.302
Candice, you can't work here anymore.

00:00:41.576 --> 00:00:49.208
No other hospital in Chicago
will hire you either.

00:00:54.255 --> 00:01:00.005
Fired! I am fired!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.536
Sir,

00:01:08.536 --> 00:01:12.563
I don't understand.

00:01:12.674 --> 00:01:16.111
You are fired, and that's it.

00:01:16.311 --> 00:01:18.179
Sir,

00:01:18.179 --> 00:01:23.184
you're saying I am fired and
no other hospital will hire me?

00:01:23.184 --> 00:01:25.914
What can I do?

00:01:27.522 --> 00:01:32.088
I can't leave my job.

00:01:32.293 --> 00:01:36.930
Candy, try to understand my situation.

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:43.368
Is it an order from the director?

00:01:44.205 --> 00:01:49.370
I doubt that even he could help you.

00:01:49.677 --> 00:01:53.581
Someone at a higher position?

00:01:53.581 --> 00:01:59.349
Candice, what's the relation
between you and the Leagan family?

00:02:00.722 --> 00:02:03.247
I start to understand what's going on...

00:02:03.958 --> 00:02:06.694
I am sure
Mr. Leagan is not aware of this.

00:02:06.694 --> 00:02:09.959
It has to be Mrs. Leagan.

00:02:11.032 --> 00:02:14.736
Mrs. Leagan has something to do
with this?

00:02:16.437 --> 00:02:19.838
Eliza and Neil
must have asked this from her.

00:02:23.277 --> 00:02:24.645
I understand.

00:02:24.645 --> 00:02:27.805
Since Mrs. Leagan asked you to fire me,
there is nothing we can do.

00:02:28.015 --> 00:02:29.812
I will resign.

00:02:30.418 --> 00:02:33.546
Sorry, Candice.

00:02:50.404 --> 00:02:55.205
I wanted to be a nurse
so I came here.

00:02:55.376 --> 00:03:02.680
I made it,
but now everything is over.

00:03:03.518 --> 00:03:07.386
But now, I have to say good bye
to St Joanna Hospital.

00:03:10.858 --> 00:03:16.194
Mr. Albert will be very disappointed
when I tell him I was fired.

00:03:17.498 --> 00:03:20.331
I will hide all of this from him,
for now.

00:03:26.741 --> 00:03:30.074
Albert, what's wrong?

00:03:30.478 --> 00:03:33.936
What's wrong with me, suddenly...?

00:03:37.318 --> 00:03:39.650
Poope!

00:03:39.987 --> 00:03:46.153
I feel bad, very bad.

00:03:50.898 --> 00:03:55.665
Such a beautiful new car!
Candy will be impressed!

00:03:56.103 --> 00:03:57.457
Neil?

00:03:58.206 --> 00:04:03.303
Thank you for inviting me.
Eliza told me.

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:08.381
I want to take a ride in this car too,
where do you want to take me to?

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.853
Is this a joke or what?

00:04:11.853 --> 00:04:15.311
Neil, it's OK, you decide.

00:04:17.992 --> 00:04:19.983
Shit!

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:33.333
I am just killing time here,
I'm so bored...

00:04:33.507 --> 00:04:38.376
I want to go back earlier,
and tidy my room.

00:04:50.057 --> 00:04:51.854
It's Candy!

00:04:52.126 --> 00:04:56.397
Good, I will drive by her.

00:05:01.802 --> 00:05:07.074
Candy, we wanted to take a ride
in my brand new car. Right, Daisy?

00:05:07.074 --> 00:05:08.542
Yes, Neil!

00:05:08.542 --> 00:05:10.669
Neil!

00:05:11.245 --> 00:05:13.247
What, Candy?

00:05:13.247 --> 00:05:16.808
Nothing, you bastard!

00:05:17.685 --> 00:05:20.855
Ah! My brand new car!

00:05:20.855 --> 00:05:23.658
Eliza and you had me fired,
it's all your fault!

00:05:23.658 --> 00:05:26.559
But that won't stop me!

00:05:28.462 --> 00:05:31.799
Who was that? She was so rude!

00:05:31.799 --> 00:05:34.700
This is bad.

00:05:35.336 --> 00:05:39.739
She must have been jealous
of seeing us together.

00:05:40.741 --> 00:05:42.445
Perhaps.

00:05:42.645 --> 00:05:46.781
Yes, she is very upset
that I broke up with her.

00:05:46.781 --> 00:05:50.911
You're very popular,
that's fantastic!

00:05:52.586 --> 00:05:56.488
Candy was fired by the hospital?

00:05:58.492 --> 00:06:01.427
Daisy, please get out of the car.

00:06:02.063 --> 00:06:03.731
What's going on, Neil?

00:06:03.931 --> 00:06:07.328
I have something important to do,
I am sorry.

00:06:09.036 --> 00:06:12.062
Neil, what about me?

00:06:15.343 --> 00:06:18.713
Candy, welcome!

00:06:18.713 --> 00:06:21.816
Good to see you, Mr. Thomas.

00:06:21.816 --> 00:06:24.185
You were done early today.

00:06:24.185 --> 00:06:26.854
Yes, I came earlier.

00:06:32.693 --> 00:06:35.127
He's not back from work, yet.

00:06:37.598 --> 00:06:42.831
Though there's no hope, I'll try
to get hired by another hospital.

00:06:50.478 --> 00:06:56.212
I will do a bit of cleaning.
Albert will be surprised!

00:07:09.363 --> 00:07:11.422
Poope!

00:07:13.534 --> 00:07:18.938
Where's this place? Why am I here?

00:07:20.441 --> 00:07:23.103
It feels like I woke up
from a long sleep.

00:07:26.747 --> 00:07:28.151
Poope!

00:07:34.422 --> 00:07:36.947
Yes, Candy

00:07:37.525 --> 00:07:42.758
She always had such a lovely smile.

00:07:43.798 --> 00:07:46.562
I met her at different times
of my life.

00:07:53.908 --> 00:07:56.138
When she almost drown.

00:08:03.818 --> 00:08:07.720
After Anthony's death.

00:08:14.728 --> 00:08:21.345
And of course there was London...
I got her letter, in Africa.

00:08:35.082 --> 00:08:39.153
Then, there was a train,
and explosions...

00:08:39.153 --> 00:08:42.714
After that, I was brought to the
hospital, and now I am living with her.

00:08:44.024 --> 00:08:53.797
That's right,
I fainted at the restaurant.

00:08:54.435 --> 00:08:56.437
I had dishes in my hand.

00:08:56.437 --> 00:09:01.704
Poope, I am slowly recovering.

00:09:09.548 --> 00:09:13.587
Candy was fired by the hospital.

00:09:13.587 --> 00:09:16.390
You did this, Eliza!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:19.660
Brother is also happy, right?

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.698
Of course!

00:09:24.698 --> 00:09:30.796
Since we want her out of Chicago...

00:09:31.438 --> 00:09:34.703
Candy got what she deserves.

00:09:48.522 --> 00:09:50.724
What should I do, Poope?

00:09:50.724 --> 00:09:56.492
Now that I recovered my memory,
can I still stay with Candy?

00:09:58.899 --> 00:10:04.064
I was able to live with her
only because I was her patient.

00:10:07.675 --> 00:10:11.805
Poope, you would like
to live with Candy, right?

00:10:11.979 --> 00:10:15.142
Yes, let's go back.

00:10:18.953 --> 00:10:24.653
I shouldn't tell her
my memory has recovered.

00:10:38.539 --> 00:10:42.407
Sorry, we can't hire you as a nurse.

00:10:52.286 --> 00:10:56.916
I am refused by so many hospitals.

00:10:57.291 --> 00:11:02.319
No other hospital in Chicago
will hire you.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.365
Mrs. Leagan is very powerful.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.430
Candy! Candy!

00:11:13.307 --> 00:11:16.799
Mr. Albert and Dr. Martin!

00:11:16.977 --> 00:11:19.280
What are you doing here?

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:24.752
I am guessing she has been fired!

00:11:24.752 --> 00:11:25.786
Eh...

00:11:25.786 --> 00:11:27.655
Is it true, Candy?

00:11:27.655 --> 00:11:29.748
Yes.

00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:35.425
Danger! A lion has escaped!

00:11:44.838 --> 00:11:46.173
Mr. Albert!

00:11:46.173 --> 00:11:48.073
Candy.

00:11:51.345 --> 00:11:55.645
- The lion!
- That's not good.

00:11:58.519 --> 00:12:00.254
Stand back.

00:12:00.254 --> 00:12:04.953
Let's hide behind a tree.
But move very slowly!

00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.861
Candy!

00:12:23.377 --> 00:12:25.470
Mr. Albert!

00:12:28.282 --> 00:12:30.580
We won't be able to capture it alive.

00:12:32.286 --> 00:12:34.345
Think about something!

00:12:37.024 --> 00:12:39.390
Put your gun down!

00:12:39.493 --> 00:12:42.363
The lion is out of control!

00:12:42.363 --> 00:12:47.130
We have to kill it!

00:12:47.301 --> 00:12:49.997
Don't!

00:12:50.571 --> 00:13:01.345
Don't be afraid. I am not your enemy.

00:13:01.815 --> 00:13:05.419
I know your home in Africa.

00:13:05.419 --> 00:13:10.814
Come, I am your friend.

00:13:11.959 --> 00:13:22.494
OK, good boy.

00:13:32.179 --> 00:13:35.249
Albert, you are a hero!

00:13:35.249 --> 00:13:38.419
You tamed that lion
just like it was a kitty.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.988
I thought you were going to die!

00:13:40.988 --> 00:13:42.189
You are exaggerating.

00:13:42.189 --> 00:13:47.161
I was really worried.

00:13:47.161 --> 00:13:49.963
Candy, you're a really good
little nurse.

00:13:49.963 --> 00:13:52.266
You cannot stay without a job.

00:13:52.266 --> 00:13:54.461
Little?

00:13:57.271 --> 00:14:01.675
Would you like to work
for the most famous doctor in Chicago?

00:14:01.675 --> 00:14:03.944
I would like to introduce you to him.

00:14:03.944 --> 00:14:06.580
That would be great,
who is this doctor?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.614
I am!

00:14:08.749 --> 00:14:10.017
You don't want to?

00:14:10.017 --> 00:14:14.955
Well... so you are
the best doctor in Chicago ?

00:14:14.955 --> 00:14:20.188
I do accept!

00:14:22.463 --> 00:14:24.829
So it's a deal!

00:14:28.101 --> 00:14:30.661
Next!

00:14:34.007 --> 00:14:35.676
It's OK.

00:14:35.676 --> 00:14:37.644
Thank you, Candy.

00:14:40.314 --> 00:14:41.782
Candy, where's the key?

00:14:41.782 --> 00:14:44.017
Here!

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:47.855
You're very brave,
I'll give you a kiss.

00:14:50.591 --> 00:14:56.552
Since Candy's here,
I have so many patients!

00:15:03.437 --> 00:15:09.643
I don't know what I'd do
without her now!

00:15:09.643 --> 00:15:13.272
Here, drink it slowly.

00:15:14.915 --> 00:15:17.618
You should relax,
it's lunch time for you too!

00:15:17.618 --> 00:15:19.545
Thank you.

00:15:20.053 --> 00:15:22.990
Candy, you are the best nurse
in the world!

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.258
Thank you for your praise.

00:15:24.258 --> 00:15:26.317
I will go and have lunch now.

00:15:28.595 --> 00:15:32.793
I added water in the bottle,
I wonder if he will notice!

00:15:35.369 --> 00:15:40.739
It's hard for him, but I have
to help him dealing with his problem.

00:15:41.775 --> 00:15:44.778
Candy, come with me.

00:15:44.778 --> 00:15:48.548
- Neil!
- I was waiting for you!

00:15:48.748 --> 00:15:50.984
Don't you hear me?

00:15:50.984 --> 00:15:52.853
I heard you.

00:15:52.853 --> 00:15:53.987
Wait up!

00:15:53.987 --> 00:15:55.722
Leave me alone!

00:15:55.722 --> 00:15:59.359
I found some work for you.

00:15:59.359 --> 00:16:02.624
Don't worry, I already found a job.

00:16:03.597 --> 00:16:05.899
But I am going to ask you something.

00:16:05.899 --> 00:16:10.962
I am listening to you, Candy.

00:16:11.638 --> 00:16:14.163
What do you want to do?

00:16:16.076 --> 00:16:22.072
Don't ever follow me again,
do you understand?

00:16:22.149 --> 00:16:25.641
You're stupid,
still thinking of that silly actor!

00:16:33.693 --> 00:16:35.224
Read this!

00:16:41.635 --> 00:16:44.934
Terry!

00:16:46.273 --> 00:16:52.143
On the first page,
Terrius G Grandchester quits the theatre.

00:16:55.015 --> 00:16:59.418
Terry doesn't want to be
an actor anymore!

00:17:00.654 --> 00:17:02.713
I don't know where he is...

00:17:02.889 --> 00:17:08.850
After we departed,
he probably got very sad.

00:17:09.463 --> 00:17:13.092
It might have been harder for him.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:19.370
Terry, that summer in Scotland
was like a beautiful dream.

00:17:20.007 --> 00:17:24.876
But now, you can't fulfil
your dream anymore.

00:17:28.415 --> 00:17:36.015
Suzanna !
Terry and Suzanna !

00:17:36.556 --> 00:17:43.519
After I left, he's never recovered,
and Suzanna needed him.

00:17:49.403 --> 00:17:52.305
What, you again?

00:17:52.305 --> 00:17:54.641
Are you angry at something?

00:17:54.641 --> 00:17:55.876
Mr. Albert!

00:17:55.876 --> 00:17:57.944
Mr. Albert, where did you get that car?

00:17:57.944 --> 00:17:59.680
The guy who was chasing the lion
introduced me to the owner,

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:04.685
he hired me and he gave me
enough money for this!

00:18:04.685 --> 00:18:08.255
It's a bit old,

00:18:08.255 --> 00:18:11.591
but it still rides very fast.

00:18:11.591 --> 00:18:14.861
Don't worry,
I have Dr. Martin's permission!

00:18:14.861 --> 00:18:16.522
I am so happy!

00:18:27.674 --> 00:18:30.472
I brought some food.

00:18:30.544 --> 00:18:32.009
Mr. Albert,
you thought of everything!

00:18:32.209 --> 00:18:36.817
But I didn't have enough money
to buy food for the both of us.

00:18:36.817 --> 00:18:39.251
It doesn't matter, we can share.

00:18:42.289 --> 00:18:46.026
Candy, it's good to share with you.

00:18:48.261 --> 00:18:53.426
I would really like it
if you could confide in me.

00:18:54.134 --> 00:18:55.897
Mr. Albert!

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.161
It's a deal.

00:19:02.809 --> 00:19:06.609
Thank you, Mr. Albert!

00:19:12.586 --> 00:19:14.855
See you tomorrow, Doctor.

00:19:14.855 --> 00:19:16.156
OK, thank you.

00:19:16.156 --> 00:19:18.859
Thank you for having let me
have lunch with Albert.

00:19:18.859 --> 00:19:20.761
That's OK.

00:19:20.761 --> 00:19:22.422
See you!

00:19:25.132 --> 00:19:28.802
Don't drink too much!

00:19:28.802 --> 00:19:30.627
Got it.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.043
Good bye, Sister!

00:19:37.043 --> 00:19:39.307
Good bye.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.949
Are you Miss Candy?

00:19:42.949 --> 00:19:44.584
Yes.

00:19:44.584 --> 00:19:49.523
Someone asked me to look for you.

00:19:49.523 --> 00:19:51.291
Someone wants to see me?

00:19:51.491 --> 00:19:53.760
His name is Terrius.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.887
Terrius!

00:19:57.864 --> 00:20:03.063
It's Terry... Terry came to see me!

00:20:03.603 --> 00:20:05.472
Could you follow me?

00:20:05.472 --> 00:20:07.406
Yes.

00:20:15.282 --> 00:20:19.786
Terry, I thought everything was over.

00:20:19.786 --> 00:20:24.553
I never even dreamt of this moment.

00:20:24.791 --> 00:20:28.093
Everything will be better.

00:20:36.703 --> 00:20:39.263
He is there, in the villa.

00:20:58.625 --> 00:21:04.222
Terry! Terry!

00:21:13.306 --> 00:21:21.213
Candy was so happy
at the idea of seeing Terry again.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:23.100
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by Rémi
